Changes made in style-xlsx-m (by Shahrom Shukurov):
- XLSX.read / XLSX.readFile with { cellStyles: true } expose selected cell styles
  (xlsx format only), with round-trip limitations documented in README.md.
- XLSX.utils.sheet_to_json accepts { getCellStyles: true } and returns
  { out, styles }.
- Worksheet page setup (paperSize, scale, fitToWidth, orientation) is read
  from and written to .xlsx files via ws['!pageSetup'].
- XLSX.write / writeFile / writeFileSync / writeXLSX / writeFileXLSX are
  delegated to the bundled xlsx-js-style build.

